---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const entry = {
  "id": "harvard_vi4_234",
  "series": "Band VI 4 (1677 - 1690)",
  "seq": 234,
  "text": "[[922.9]] <b>193.  De modis combinandi characteres [Sommer 1688 bis Ende 1699 (?)]</b>\n [[922.10]] <tab/>[Sommer 1688 bis Ende 1699 (?)] </p>\n<p> [[922.19]] Omnis Ratiocinatio nostra nihil aliud est quam characterum connexio, et substitutio.\n[[922.20]] Sive illi characteres sint verba, sive notae, sive denique imagines. Omnis autem substitutio\n[[922.21]] nascitur ex aequipollentia quadam. </p>\n<p> [[922.22]] Porro ex his patet, omnem Ratiocinationem esse quandam combinationem Characterum.\n[[922.23]] Est autem combinatio vel ab ordine absoluta, vel ordinem respiciens; est item vel\n[[922.24]] similaris, inter characteres, quorum quisque tractatur eodem modo, vel dissimilaris. Item\n[[923.1]] vel in ea ejusdem characteris repetitio vel variat aliquid vel non variat, quae est specialis\n[[923.2]] combinatio, cum <i>AA</i> ^&.SE <Leibniz special character> <i>A</i>. </p>\n<p> [[923.3]] Praeterea Combinatoria est composita, cum diversi modi connectendi characteres\n[[923.4]] simul conjunguntur, v.g. <i>ab</i> + <i>cd</i> patet <i>a</i> et <i>b</i> inter se alio modo connecti, quam <i>ab</i> et <i>cd</i>;\n[[923.5]] quo pertinent notae ablationum, etiam duplices pro duplici modo ascribendi. Et hae duae\n[[923.6]] rationes connectendi obtinent in calculo algebraico. Et tamen nihil prohibet dari in natura\n[[923.7]] combinationes, ubi adhuc plures modi connectendi simul conjungantur; sunt et modi\n[[923.8]] connectendi alii similares, alii dissimilares; similaris est, ut <i>ab</i>, <i>a</i> + <i>b</i>, dissimilares horum\n[[923.9]] reciproci seu notae auferendi ut <i>ab</i> : <i>b</i>; <i>a</i> + <i>b</i> ─ <i>b</i>. Item si scribas <i>a^#'b</i>. Nota: nihil impedire,\n[[923.10]] quo minus quando duo diversi modi connectendi ambo similares junguntur, alter in\n[[923.11]] alterum permutetur, si scilicet nihil adscriptum est, quo distinguantur, sed hoc tantum\n[[923.12]] esse diversos, sic ex <i>ab</i> + <i>cd</i> posset fieri <i>a</i> + <i>b</i> · <i>c</i> + <i>d</i>, nihil enim prohiberet multiplicationem\n[[923.13]] repraesentari per +, additionem per ascriptionem, et multiplicando <i>ab</i> + <i>cd</i> in\n[[923.14]] <i>ab</i> ─ <i>cd</i> scribi posset: ^#5+<i>a</i> + <i>b</i>^#5-^#4+ · ^#4-^#5+<i>c</i> + <i>d</i>^#5- + ^#5+<i>a</i> + <i>b</i>^#5-^#4+ : ^#4-^#5+<i>c</i> + <i>d</i>^#5-, unde foret:\n [[923.15]] ^#5+<i>a</i> + <i>a</i> + <i>b</i> + <i>b</i>^#5-^#4+ · ^#4-^#5+<i>c</i> + <i>d</i> +<i>a</i> + <i>b</i>^#5- : ^#5+<i>c</i> + <i>d</i> + <i>a</i> + <i>b</i>^#5-^#4+ · ^#4-^#5+<i>c</i> + <i>c</i> + <i>d</i> + <i>d</i>^#5- seu\n [[923.16]] ^#6+<i>a</i> + <i>a</i> + <i>b</i> + <i>b</i>^#6- : ^#6+<i>c</i> + <i>c</i> +<i>d</i> + <i>d</i>^#6-, hoc est communi more <i>aabb</i> ─ <i>ccdd</i>. </p>\n<p> [[923.17]] Ex variis modis combinandi, ubi se termini vel similariter vel [dissimilariter] habent,\n[[923.18]] oriuntur nomina catholica relationes significantia, seu Terminis imponibilia, quibus\n[[923.19]] deinde catholice exprimi possunt, quae per characteres Ecthetice; idque aptum est memoriae,\n[[923.20]] nam Ecthetica expressio scripturae apta est, sermoni vero apta non est. </p>\n",
  "number": "193.",
  "title": "De modis combinandi characteres",
  "date": "[Sommer 1688 bis Ende 1699 (?)]"
};
---

<Layout title={`${entry.title || entry.id} - Leibniz Writings`}>
  <article data-pagefind-body>
    <header class="entry-header">
      <h1 data-pagefind-meta="title">{entry.title || entry.id}</h1>

      <div class="entry-meta">
        {entry.date && (
          <div class="meta-item">
            <strong>Date:</strong>
            <span data-pagefind-meta="date">{entry.date}</span>
          </div>
        )}

        <div class="meta-item">
          <strong>Series:</strong>
          <span data-pagefind-meta="series">{entry.series}</span>
        </div>

        {entry.number && (
          <div class="meta-item">
            <strong>Number:</strong>
            <span data-pagefind-meta="number">{entry.number}</span>
          </div>
        )}

        <div class="meta-item">
          <strong>Sequence:</strong>
          <span>{entry.seq}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="entry-content" data-pagefind-meta="excerpt:193. De modis combinandi characteres [Sommer 1688 bis Ende 1699 (?)] [Sommer 1688 bis Ende 1699 (?)] Omnis Ratiocinatio nostra nihil aliud est quam characterum connexio, et substitutio. Sive illi characteres sint verba, sive notae, sive denique imagines. Omnis autem substitutio nascitur ex aequipoll...">
      <div class="text-content">
        {entry.text.split('\n').map(paragraph =>
          paragraph.trim() && <p set:html={paragraph} />
        )}
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <nav class="entry-navigation">
    <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Search</a>
  </nav>
</Layout>

<style>
  .entry-header {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
  }

  .entry-header h1 {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .entry-meta {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .meta-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .meta-item strong {
    color: var(--text);
    min-width: 80px;
  }

  .meta-item span {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    flex: 1;
  }

  .entry-content {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .text-content {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 30px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .text-content :global(p) {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .text-content :global(p:last-child) {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .text-content :global(b) {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .entry-navigation {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 20px;
  }

  .back-link {
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--primary-dark);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .entry-meta {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>